# ==============================================================================
# AI STUDY PLATFORM - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Frontend Client Configuration (Vite)
# Obtain these from your Supabase Project Settings -> API:
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# ==============================================================================
# 2. Server-Side Edge Function Secrets (NEVER EXPOSE IN BROWSER CODE)
# Configure these securely in Supabase using the CLI:
#
#   supabase secrets set GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_groq_key
#   supabase secrets set GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
#   supabase secrets set YOUTUBE_API_KEY=your_google_youtube_api_key
#
# Available Groq models for curriculum decomposition and lesson generation:
# - llama-3.3-70b-versatile (Recommended default)
# - llama-3.1-8b-instant (Fast response)
# - mixtral-8x7b-32768
# ==============================================================================
